id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19835::$$$message_0158_0000_0000$$$::"SHOCK![lr]::
19836::$$$message_0158_0000_0001$$$::You destroyed all the tough questions I spent a year and a half thinking up in several minutes!"::
19837::$$$message_0158_0001_0000$$$::The Quiz Fiend practically turns to stone from the feet up.[lr]::
19838::$$$message_0158_0001_0001$$$::Since ancient times, there's always been a tried-and-true method of beating monsters.[lr]::
19839::$$$message_0158_0001_0002$$$::Whether it be a sphinx or a mikoshi-nyudo, even the most invincible monsters can be vanquished by their own words!::
19840::$$$message_0158_0002_0000$$$::"Damn you! [wvl canskip=0 time=300][lquake vmax=5 hmax=8 storage=藤_クイズ鬼01a石(中) interval=0]But don't forget, pervy little kappa[line len=2]I can come back to life as many times as it takes! As long as heroines exist[line len=2]as long as unrewarded minor characters exist, I can always take a VTOL back up from the underworld![lr]::
19841::$$$message_0158_0002_0001$$$::Oooh, such is man's karma...! Sinner, thy name is humaaaaannn..."::
19842::$$$message_0158_0003_0000$$$::"You've unlocked the bath in the Emiya residence!"::
19843::$$$message_0158_0003_0001$$$::"How do I put it... That sure was some kinda monster."[lr]::
19844::$$$message_0158_0003_0002$$$::She's probably learned her lesson for the time being.[lr]::
19845::$$$message_0158_0003_0003$$$::I've gained a new treasure. I'll say a quick prayer for the dead and go back to the castle.::
919837::$$$message_9158_0001_0000$$$::The Quiz Fiend practically turns to stone from the feet up.[r]::

